# ECB Architecture Rules

## Boundary layer

- Responsibilities:
  - Parse external inputs into canonical grid (row-major 16 ints)
  - Validate dimension/type/completeness and raise/return `InputError`
  - Serialize `VerdictResult` to external DTO/JSON (optional)
- Must not:
  - Implement domain invariants (I-1~I-3)
  - Implement generation algorithms

## Control layer

- Responsibilities:
  - Fix and load profile `MS4X4_STD_V1` (do not allow ad-hoc variants)
  - Enforce check order: input format → I-1 → I-2/I-3
  - Assemble deterministic `VerdictResult`
- Must not:
  - Depend on boundary details (CLI/UI/HTTP specifics)
  - Process raw external input without boundary adapter

## Entity layer

- Responsibilities:
  - Domain data + invariants: Grid, Verdict, Violation, MagicLine, Profile
  - I-1 multiset, I-2/I-3 line sums, constant=34
- Must not:
  - Import pytest, logging config, file I/O, frameworks
  - Contain UI/CLI code

## Dependency direction (enforce)

- Allowed: `boundary → control`, `control → entity`
- Allowed (limited): `boundary → entity` (DTO/enum sharing only)
- Forbidden: `entity → control`, `entity → boundary`, `control → boundary`

